**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
.git
*.md
logs/*.log.bak

# origination-service builds from the REPO ROOT so the image can carry rag_eval/ (card G2a).
# Every other context is a subdirectory, so this file was inert until that change; it is live
# now, and .env sits at the root of the new context.
#
# Credentials must never enter a build context. .env carries POSTGRES_PASSWORD (no committed
# default) and a developer's .env.local may carry CLAUDE_API_KEY or AWS keys, which compose
# injects from the host shell precisely so they stay out of the tree.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Embedding cache: rebuilt per run, never part of the image.
rag_eval/.cache
